WEBVTT

00:07.460 --> 00:10.430
Fall in love, boys and girls

00:11.030 --> 00:14.000
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

00:14.600 --> 00:17.460
The passion, the way it was born

00:17.970 --> 00:20.940
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

00:21.840 --> 00:24.810
How the hips shake, mucho dizzying

00:25.340 --> 00:28.400
Amigo, that's risky for a kid

00:29.010 --> 00:32.070
If I were to kiss, I'd get sucked in

00:32.650 --> 00:35.050
Tonight, I want to see something scary

00:36.150 --> 00:38.020
Don't be afraid

00:38.020 --> 00:39.860
Going from one push after another

00:39.860 --> 00:41.690
The surprising feeling is nice

00:41.690 --> 00:43.220
And you end up dancing till morning

00:43.790 --> 00:45.230
LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:45.230 --> 00:48.600
TROPICANA

00:50.430 --> 00:53.660
Catch me in the shade under the palm tree

00:54.300 --> 00:57.400
Make me wait, more than down to the limit

00:57.940 --> 01:00.970
I'm sorry, but you're already addicted

01:01.540 --> 01:04.570
From the jungle you can't escape! Haré+Guu!

01:05.280 --> 01:08.220
Fall in love, boys and girls

01:08.790 --> 01:11.780
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

01:12.360 --> 01:15.420
The passion, the way it was born

01:16.060 --> 01:17.960
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

01:30.920 --> 01:32.280
I drank too much...

01:40.130 --> 01:41.220
Oh, geez...

01:49.500 --> 01:52.060
Ojou-sama, how are you feeling?

01:57.950 --> 02:01.750
Being like this with you, Ojou-sama,
reminds me of the past...

02:01.820 --> 02:02.750
Really?

02:02.950 --> 02:07.580
The times we spent together in this estate
when you were very young, Ojou-sama...

02:07.760 --> 02:10.280
How sweet and wonderful a time it was...

02:11.390 --> 02:13.830
Getting exited seeing your sleeping face...

02:14.960 --> 02:18.020
Diligently creating a
photo album of your pictures...

02:19.070 --> 02:21.930
Sniffing the scent you left behind...

02:22.600 --> 02:26.400
Oh, they're all such great memories!

02:28.910 --> 02:30.430
Memories, huh...

02:35.020 --> 02:38.950
What I keep remembering
is the day I left this house...

02:42.820 --> 02:45.490
Expecting to never return to this house...

02:56.800 --> 02:57.770
No...

02:59.170 --> 03:01.510
I thought I'd never want to
step foot inside this house again.

03:02.710 --> 03:05.510
If she was worried about her daughter,
she could have called.

03:05.810 --> 03:07.850
Yet, she couldn't say what was on her mind.

03:07.850 --> 03:09.680
Mother was nothing but an ornament.

03:11.150 --> 03:13.620
She was just like me, and I really hated that.

03:17.190 --> 03:18.820
I never want to see her again.

03:23.500 --> 03:24.520
Never...

03:25.930 --> 03:27.830
I'm bored...

03:28.070 --> 03:30.440
I wonder what Mom's doing.

03:30.940 --> 03:32.870
I think I'll go over to Mom's room.

03:33.040 --> 03:35.310
Mom this, Mom that. Can't you give it a rest?

03:35.510 --> 03:39.650
You can't stop believing in
your fantasy that you and your mother are
one and the same spiritually...

03:39.650 --> 03:43.980
...and are experimenting with a twisted
mother and child relationship.

03:44.150 --> 03:46.750
What's that really
roundabout criticism mean?

03:47.420 --> 03:48.320
Oedipus Complex!

03:48.420 --> 03:49.550
That's too blunt!

03:49.920 --> 03:51.410
Doesn't it make you wonder?

03:51.490 --> 03:53.660
She was so dead set on
not wanting to come back to the city.

03:53.660 --> 03:57.360
And every day here is just
like the life back in the jungle.

03:57.900 --> 04:00.300
Really, why did she
decide to come back here?

04:00.300 --> 04:03.300
She mentioned before that
she had an older brother and sister...

04:03.300 --> 04:06.170
...yet nobody's coming here to visit us...

04:06.310 --> 04:09.040
No matter their reasons, this family is full of
cold-hearted people!

04:10.310 --> 04:12.750
Haré-sama, do you have
any errands for me to run?

04:13.080 --> 04:14.140
Errands?

04:14.450 --> 04:17.510
I'm rotting away from boredom,
sheer boredom! There are no errands!

04:17.620 --> 04:19.180
Dammit, you're annoying!

04:19.920 --> 04:21.680
If there's someone with a
laugh that you don't like...

04:22.290 --> 04:25.520
...or someone who bumped into you and
walked away without apologizing...

04:26.030 --> 04:27.930
...or people who spit on the road
as they walk...

04:28.860 --> 04:31.200
If there are annoying people like that...

04:32.270 --> 04:33.830
Oh, that sort of errand.

04:34.240 --> 04:37.870
Anyway, there isn't anyone in this mansion
that I hate.

04:37.870 --> 04:39.400
Dammit, you're annoying!

04:39.510 --> 04:40.600
Sycophant.

04:40.840 --> 04:43.070
Everyone is nice to me.

04:43.210 --> 04:44.270
Suck-up.

04:44.380 --> 04:47.180
Why are you saying such annoying stuff?

04:47.480 --> 04:48.180
Honesty.

04:48.320 --> 04:49.150
I'm telling you...

04:50.320 --> 04:54.350
You know, it's nice to have an easy life,
but there's nothing left to do.

04:54.520 --> 04:55.650
Something to do?

04:55.960 --> 04:58.430
Oh, but you don't have to go out of your way
to find something!

04:58.660 --> 04:59.720
Especially you, Guu!

05:00.500 --> 05:01.990
What's with the 'tch'?

05:04.070 --> 05:06.120
How much longer are we going to be here?

05:06.330 --> 05:08.060
Are we really going to stay here forever?

05:08.840 --> 05:10.810
The school doc was out here the other day.

05:10.810 --> 05:13.000
I should've asked him how everyone in the
jungle was doing.

05:13.370 --> 05:17.480
No, I'm not going to resort to something so
humiliating as asking him for a favor!

05:17.480 --> 05:17.940
Haré-sama...

05:20.010 --> 05:21.000
Let's play!

05:23.320 --> 05:24.550
I'll tell you now...

05:24.620 --> 05:28.350
No driving. No shooting lessons.
No etiquette classes. No shopping.
And no stalking! Okay?

05:28.790 --> 05:29.720
Oh, please!

05:29.720 --> 05:33.630
The two of us came us with a fun pastime
that we can play right here in the mansion!

05:33.830 --> 05:35.160
"The two of us"?

05:35.360 --> 05:36.390
Tag.

05:37.530 --> 05:38.970
Tag.

05:39.330 --> 05:42.300
TERROR!

05:43.140 --> 05:46.240
Tag... Tag... Tag... Tag...

05:46.240 --> 05:49.800
Tag... Tag... Tag... Tag... Tag... Tag... Tag... Tag...

05:50.580 --> 05:51.340
Fine.

05:51.780 --> 05:53.010
Well, I'm bored anyway.

05:53.380 --> 05:54.110
All right!

05:54.180 --> 05:56.510
The boundary is the interior of the mansion.

05:57.550 --> 05:58.920
Then, paper...

05:58.920 --> 05:59.790
...rock...

05:59.790 --> 06:00.450
...scissors!

06:00.590 --> 06:02.420
Oh, Guu-san, you're it.

06:03.620 --> 06:05.190
Now, now, let's go!

06:05.190 --> 06:05.590
Right!

06:06.160 --> 06:09.130
Guu-san, come chasing us
after you count to ten.

06:09.430 --> 06:10.160
Run away!

06:12.270 --> 06:16.260
One, two, three...

06:16.970 --> 06:19.200
Whoa! Haré-sama, you sure run fast!

06:19.270 --> 06:20.870
Oh, yeah... well, I'm good at running.

06:21.140 --> 06:22.670
Oh, hold on a second!

06:32.090 --> 06:33.820
W-W-What was that?

06:38.630 --> 06:39.590
G-Guu?

06:40.530 --> 06:43.520
W-W-W-What did you just do?

06:45.830 --> 06:47.700
What's called an "It" should act like an "It."

06:47.840 --> 06:50.460
W-What are you talking about? What does
"acting like an It" mean?

06:51.340 --> 06:53.140
What's called an "It" should act like an "It."

06:58.110 --> 06:59.600
Oh, good day, Haré-sama.

07:13.930 --> 07:17.060
No! This is different from usual!

07:29.110 --> 07:29.840
Why?

07:30.110 --> 07:32.200
Why does this feel like a horror movie?

07:46.960 --> 07:49.260
And then there were none...

08:01.240 --> 08:04.180
He told us to stay inside the mansion.

08:06.180 --> 08:07.200
Get over here.

08:08.020 --> 08:09.570
NOOOO!!

08:14.390 --> 08:16.880
NO! She's chasing me!

08:19.060 --> 08:21.860
Oh, Bocchan, nice weather
we're havin' today!

08:25.970 --> 08:26.960
Ouch...

08:29.470 --> 08:32.270
Oh no, another victim!

08:38.810 --> 08:41.480
My fault? Is this my fault?

08:42.550 --> 08:44.070
Is it because I keep running away?

08:44.190 --> 08:48.380
No. I've been running because I was
overcome by fear...

08:49.120 --> 08:50.390
But this is no good!

08:51.160 --> 08:54.060
I have to stand up against it right now!

08:55.100 --> 08:56.530
Hey, wait a...

09:00.640 --> 09:04.040
H-Hey, Guu? Hey...

09:04.040 --> 09:04.940
Hey!

09:08.610 --> 09:09.800
I'm lost!

09:15.280 --> 09:16.880
S-So cold...

09:17.050 --> 09:18.280
At this rate...

09:18.420 --> 09:19.290
...am I camping out?

09:19.290 --> 09:20.590
No, stranded?

09:20.590 --> 09:22.090
No, freezing to death?

09:22.090 --> 09:23.520
No, starving to death?

09:23.990 --> 09:25.860
...in this unfamiliar land?

09:26.490 --> 09:30.160
Is this all because I complained
about being bored?

09:30.360 --> 09:31.390
Is this a punishment?

09:31.600 --> 09:33.460
But, who's punishing me?

09:39.310 --> 09:40.240
Hii?

09:40.680 --> 09:42.280
No way!

09:42.280 --> 09:45.580
The Hii that I loved got swallowed up by Guu.

09:45.850 --> 09:48.210
Perhaps I should have been
swallowed up by Guu, too?

09:53.650 --> 09:55.990
No, I don't want either option!

09:57.290 --> 09:58.380
That's right.

09:58.490 --> 10:02.520
Hii also fluttered his wings when he was
surprised. You're just like him.

10:03.100 --> 10:05.000
Actually... are you Hii? Are you really Hii?

10:05.330 --> 10:06.820
Yamada-san!

10:08.240 --> 10:09.540
Human voices!

10:09.540 --> 10:10.440
I'm saved!?

10:10.640 --> 10:13.540
Yamada-san!

10:13.540 --> 10:14.440
Yamada?

10:21.980 --> 10:23.480
Haré-kun, it's been a while!

10:23.480 --> 10:25.280
T-T-T-T-T-T-T-Tomoyo-san!?

10:25.350 --> 10:27.120
Haré-Haré, your voice is really loud.

10:27.120 --> 10:29.390
Actually, you surprised him, Seiichi.

10:29.820 --> 10:32.090
I thought he'd be surprised...

10:32.090 --> 10:34.290
...and Haré-Haré was really surprised!

10:34.360 --> 10:35.800
Sheesh, you shouldn't do that.

10:35.960 --> 10:38.560
Um... why are you two here?

10:40.740 --> 10:42.730
You know, listen to this!

10:43.200 --> 10:44.190
S-Sure.

10:44.370 --> 10:47.210
You know... we've been there from the
beginning, right?

10:47.310 --> 10:50.640
So it's troublesome when
new people pop up all over.

10:50.710 --> 10:53.510
Mm... well, it's all right if we can be friends...

10:53.650 --> 10:55.710
But there seem to be a lot of people who
don't understand their current situation...

10:56.580 --> 11:00.520
Understand? I probably shouldn't ask about
what they don't understand.

11:00.590 --> 11:01.490
That's right.

11:01.490 --> 11:04.010
It seems like they've got a slight
misunderstanding there.

11:04.160 --> 11:06.320
We'd like them to think
things out a little bit more.

11:06.560 --> 11:08.550
Even without all of them,
we don't have too much space.

11:08.830 --> 11:12.270
So, we thought that you, Haré-Haré, would be
able to understand.

11:13.300 --> 11:15.670
I kinda get it, but kinda don't...

11:16.240 --> 11:17.500
Oh! Where's Yamada-san?

11:19.970 --> 11:21.870
You know, listen to this!

11:21.980 --> 11:24.140
Crap! I think I dug my own grave!

11:24.210 --> 11:26.610
It's nice that we were able to step outside for
the first time in a while...

11:26.610 --> 11:27.770
But we lost sight of her.

11:27.920 --> 11:28.850
I knew it!

11:28.920 --> 11:30.710
So help us look for her!

11:30.820 --> 11:34.220
Since this is the first time she's been outside
in a while, it looks like she got homesick.

11:34.320 --> 11:37.460
Actually, I'm in big trouble
myself right now...

11:37.460 --> 11:39.480
Haré-Haré, start searching
on the right side over here.

11:39.560 --> 11:41.960
Be careful. Let us know if you find her.

11:42.030 --> 11:43.160
Oh... okay...

11:43.830 --> 11:45.260
Yamada-san, huh?

11:45.530 --> 11:48.000
Any time I see her, she has a very...
distinctive character...

11:48.400 --> 11:51.060
Wait! This is no time to criticize other people!

11:51.510 --> 11:54.780
Why are those two
- no, those three - outside!?

11:54.780 --> 11:57.540
And why the heck am
I helping to look for someone!?

12:06.250 --> 12:07.620
I hate him!

12:07.690 --> 12:10.560
I hate that division chief that dumped me!

12:10.660 --> 12:12.820
That kind of homesick, huh...

12:13.330 --> 12:15.120
H-H-H-H-Hold on there, Sis...

12:15.400 --> 12:16.490
You're...

12:16.600 --> 12:18.760
Nothing good will come out of doing
something like that.

12:18.830 --> 12:23.200
You came outside for the
first time in a while, so you should do
something more productive.

12:23.270 --> 12:24.290
Productive?

12:24.440 --> 12:30.240
W-Well, like taking lessons
for something, or going to a day-spa,
or maybe investing in something...

12:30.380 --> 12:33.070
What? You sound like
a child with no dreams.

12:35.220 --> 12:37.250
Since I'm outside for
the first time in a while...

12:37.250 --> 12:39.790
You're right, I need to do something
that I can only do now.

12:39.790 --> 12:40.750
That's right!

12:43.720 --> 12:46.060
Could she be... prank calling or something!?

12:46.360 --> 12:49.230
Wait, Big Sis! Don't go harassing him now!

12:49.330 --> 12:50.700
What are you talking about?

12:50.700 --> 12:54.230
E-mail, websites, message services...
there are so many things to do!

12:54.540 --> 12:55.520
Singles' sites!?

12:57.970 --> 12:59.230
W-What's wrong?

12:59.810 --> 13:01.600
No signal!

13:03.640 --> 13:05.440
Calm down! Calm down!

13:06.380 --> 13:07.750
Calm down!?

13:07.980 --> 13:09.850
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry...
Is there anything good that comes out of
calming down!?

13:09.850 --> 13:11.750
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry...
Will I get a million yen in cold hard cash
if I calm down?

13:11.750 --> 13:13.350
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry...
Will my weight drop below 50 kilograms
if I calm down!?

13:13.350 --> 13:17.050
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry...
Will all the people who made fun of me,
laughed at me, and ignored me suffer
if I calm down!!?

13:17.160 --> 13:20.460
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry...

13:20.800 --> 13:22.190
Um, Big Sis?

13:22.630 --> 13:23.650
What!?

13:24.000 --> 13:27.630
I believe... nothing comes out of hatred.

13:29.040 --> 13:33.940
Both happy things and sad things make you
grow into a beautiful lady.

13:35.410 --> 13:39.740
I'm only 11 years old, so it might be strange
for me to say something like this...

13:39.950 --> 13:43.420
...but I don't dislike how you're so powerful,
or how your will is so strong.

13:43.420 --> 13:44.580
I think that's amazing.

13:44.850 --> 13:50.190
If anything, instead of being buried in the
past, let's believe in the future.

13:52.360 --> 13:53.220
You...

13:53.890 --> 13:54.920
You're right.

13:55.200 --> 13:58.460
I didn't think I had anything left ahead of me.

13:59.070 --> 14:00.970
Even though that's what's most important...

14:01.940 --> 14:04.530
Age doesn't matter in romance.

14:05.710 --> 14:07.900
A new rendezvous is
just around the corner...

14:08.540 --> 14:10.340
Now, let's hurry back and
nurture our new love!

14:10.340 --> 14:11.610
W-Wait a minute!!

14:11.750 --> 14:12.800
Congratulations!

14:12.880 --> 14:14.400
Haré-Haré, you make a wonderful couple!

14:14.480 --> 14:16.280
Don't just stand by watching! Help me!

14:16.380 --> 14:17.980
Seriously... I'm in trouble if this carries on!

14:18.090 --> 14:19.120
U-Um, Sis...

14:19.120 --> 14:21.920
How about you go back ahead of me
and get ready and stuff?

14:22.120 --> 14:22.880
Get ready?

14:23.120 --> 14:23.890
Y-Y-Y-Y-Y-Yeah.

14:23.890 --> 14:25.030
There's all sorts of things...

14:25.030 --> 14:26.620
There are, aren't there?

14:27.230 --> 14:28.820
That's true...

14:30.060 --> 14:31.630
I need to put makeup on, too!

14:31.630 --> 14:33.290
And, I need a change of clothes!

14:34.370 --> 14:35.640
See you later, Haré-Haré!

14:35.640 --> 14:37.130
Come drop by our place, too!

14:37.640 --> 14:39.110
S-See you later...

14:41.680 --> 14:42.940
I've been spared...

14:42.940 --> 14:44.210
Not!?

14:44.310 --> 14:45.250
Hey!

14:45.250 --> 14:46.800
Hey...

14:47.680 --> 14:48.710
This is no good!

14:48.780 --> 14:50.050
Why did I send them back!?

14:50.050 --> 14:51.950
I was finally able to find someone!

14:52.020 --> 14:53.320
Did they really go back?

14:53.320 --> 14:54.260
Inside Guu?

14:54.260 --> 14:55.060
They've been swallowed whole again?

14:55.060 --> 14:56.290
Is the game of tag still on?

14:56.290 --> 14:58.760
The situation hasn't changed one bit!

14:58.760 --> 15:00.360
Or rather, maybe it's gotten worse?

15:00.360 --> 15:01.850
Am I stupid?

15:06.400 --> 15:07.370
What's wrong?

15:11.270 --> 15:12.030
Who is it?

15:12.370 --> 15:13.430
Are you lost?

15:14.070 --> 15:15.560
Oh, she seems like a nice person...

15:15.840 --> 15:17.500
Y-Yeah... that's right...

15:17.580 --> 15:19.100
I was playing tag with my friend...

15:22.020 --> 15:25.380
If she finds us now, I'm sure this lady will get
assaulted by Guu, too...

15:25.450 --> 15:27.150
D-Do you live near here?

15:27.250 --> 15:28.050
I do.

15:28.320 --> 15:31.520
T-Then, I hate to stand here and chat, so how
about we go back to your house?

15:32.960 --> 15:33.930
That's fine with me...

15:43.870 --> 15:45.170
Please, have some.

15:45.740 --> 15:47.300
Thanks, I'll have some!

15:47.470 --> 15:48.710
T-That's right...

15:48.710 --> 15:50.230
Manners! Manners!

15:50.710 --> 15:52.800
It's all right. Go ahead and eat.

15:52.980 --> 15:54.170
Thank you!

15:58.450 --> 15:59.610
Is it tasty?

15:59.690 --> 16:01.790
There are plenty left, so go ahead and eat up.

16:01.790 --> 16:02.450
Sure!

16:02.690 --> 16:04.350
Um, do you live all by yourself?

16:05.060 --> 16:07.150
I used to have children...

16:07.360 --> 16:08.890
Three of them.

16:09.300 --> 16:12.270
The first two got married,
and no longer live here.

16:14.740 --> 16:16.460
Wait, what about the third child?

16:17.470 --> 16:18.940
The third child used to be here...

16:19.510 --> 16:21.770
...but left home quite a while ago.

16:21.880 --> 16:23.840
My husband disowned her...

16:23.910 --> 16:24.840
Disowned?

16:25.350 --> 16:29.720
He disowned his own daughter, saying she
did something lewd.

16:30.480 --> 16:33.750
She was still a young, frail girl...

16:34.890 --> 16:37.260
...yet I couldn't protect her...

16:37.260 --> 16:38.450
...although I was her mother.

16:41.160 --> 16:46.060
The older two children got married and left
the house, and my husband passed away...

16:46.430 --> 16:51.340
After I became alone, I finally realized what a
cruel thing I had done.

16:52.410 --> 16:57.040
I wanted to see her, and wrote letter after
letter for years...

16:58.650 --> 17:00.840
...but not once did I get a reply from her.

17:01.880 --> 17:05.220
Even now, she's near me, yet she doesn't
want to see me at all...

17:05.590 --> 17:06.640
Why is that?

17:06.820 --> 17:10.520
She's mad, because I didn't do even one
thing for her as a parent.

17:10.960 --> 17:13.320
Not one thing as a parent...

17:18.070 --> 17:19.900
It makes me lonely to think that my mother...

17:19.900 --> 17:22.730
...and "Plus Alpha" immediately
come to mind.

17:23.500 --> 17:26.370
I know someone that has parents like that...

17:26.510 --> 17:29.000
...but he doesn't have any of that anger,
and doesn't avoid his parents.

17:29.110 --> 17:30.040
Really?

17:30.180 --> 17:34.580
His mom drinks lots of alcohol, is lazy,
and does none of the household chores.

17:34.580 --> 17:36.950
And, his dad plays around
with lots of women...

17:36.950 --> 17:40.010
...and is really cold-hearted to everyone
around him. Truly the worst guy ever!

17:40.190 --> 17:42.120
That sounds horrible for a married couple.

17:42.190 --> 17:43.890
Y-You're right about that...

17:43.890 --> 17:47.880
...but he knows that they both have good
points, so he doesn't hate them at all.

17:48.530 --> 17:51.990
That friend of yours must have a good
understanding of his parents.

17:52.270 --> 17:54.830
So, you shouldn't think so negatively...

17:55.500 --> 17:57.990
Then, why won't she see me?

17:59.710 --> 18:01.140
That's...

18:01.880 --> 18:04.070
I know! It must be that she's too shy!

18:04.650 --> 18:05.480
Shy?

18:05.480 --> 18:07.140
Is that really so?

18:07.310 --> 18:08.150
Yup!

18:08.150 --> 18:10.840
I'm sure she doesn't drag
along the past for so long!

18:11.050 --> 18:12.810
Yeah, probably! I'm sure of it!

18:13.950 --> 18:15.720
You're an optimist...

18:16.020 --> 18:17.350
A very positive outlook.

18:18.590 --> 18:21.360
Well, I'm forced to think this way...

18:21.660 --> 18:22.920
Oh, is that so?

18:23.030 --> 18:25.500
Perhaps I mentioned something
that I shouldn't have?

18:27.100 --> 18:28.530
Come to think of it, you...

18:28.940 --> 18:32.060
You resemble my daughter
that I was just talking about.

18:33.070 --> 18:35.370
It feels like my daughter cheered me up.

18:36.910 --> 18:38.510
I get it...

18:38.510 --> 18:40.780
So the daughter that
she was just talking about...

18:40.780 --> 18:42.810
...was my mom.

18:43.220 --> 18:45.650
That means, she's my...

18:46.050 --> 18:47.540
G-Grand...

18:51.890 --> 18:52.860
Oh!

18:53.730 --> 18:54.820
Your friend?

18:56.330 --> 18:57.230
I'm Guu.

18:57.230 --> 18:59.130
How about tea together with us?

18:59.300 --> 18:59.990
Yeah!

19:02.370 --> 19:05.100
Hey, what happened to the game of tag?

19:06.910 --> 19:08.840
I'm full now!

19:08.940 --> 19:11.350
Hey, wait, why are you so satisfied!?

19:11.350 --> 19:12.410
Spit 'um out! Out with 'um! Put them back!

19:12.410 --> 19:13.970
Don't give me that nice smile of yours!

19:14.180 --> 19:16.120
You two get along very well.

19:16.180 --> 19:18.380
In what light do you have to
look at things to believe that?

19:18.490 --> 19:21.890
When I'm with her, I have nothing but
complaints, worries, and stress!

19:22.990 --> 19:26.520
It's a wonderful thing to have
someone that you can straightforwardly
throw your complaints at.

19:26.860 --> 19:29.850
People tend to be reserved, so it's hard to
really talk about things like that.

19:31.060 --> 19:36.020
Things might have been better if I had
were able to talk things out with
my daughter like you two...

19:37.070 --> 19:38.370
Grandma...

19:38.840 --> 19:40.910
U-Um, actually, I...

19:40.910 --> 19:42.070
I feel sick.

19:42.740 --> 19:44.970
Because you shook me so much.

19:45.050 --> 19:46.100
Oh, sorry.

19:46.410 --> 19:47.900
Oh my, are you all right?

19:48.320 --> 19:50.650
I can't hold it in. They've come
up to my mouth now.

19:50.750 --> 19:51.480
Seriously!?

19:53.120 --> 19:55.320
I'm sorry, I think we'll be going home now.

19:55.520 --> 19:57.260
Oh my... will she be all right?

19:57.260 --> 19:58.620
Yeah! See you!

20:16.110 --> 20:18.670
So Grandma has been
thinking things like that...

20:19.250 --> 20:23.340
It wasn't that she didn't care
at all about Mom or me...

20:26.120 --> 20:28.180
Ouch! What the heck!?

20:33.430 --> 20:35.220
Don't just spew people all over the place!

20:36.260 --> 20:39.470
You want me to digest everything I swallow?

20:39.470 --> 20:40.330
No!

20:40.400 --> 20:42.030
Oh, I feel refreshed now.

20:42.240 --> 20:44.100
Then don't swallow them in the first place!

20:48.040 --> 20:50.130
What am I doing all the way out here?

20:52.180 --> 20:54.510
I thought I was playing
around in the mansion...

20:55.080 --> 20:59.080
So I'm not given even a moment to be thrilled
about meeting my grandmother?

20:59.190 --> 21:00.920
Now, you're "It".

22:36.060 --> 22:36.960
NEXT EPISODE

22:36.960 --> 22:39.190
Oh man, it's the end already?

22:39.190 --> 22:40.790
Come to think of it, all sorts of things happened...

22:40.790 --> 22:42.030
Really.

22:42.030 --> 22:46.170
I remember how you, Haré fought inside that giant robot with the future of
mankind at stake.

22:46.170 --> 22:48.140
It seems like yesterday.

22:48.370 --> 22:49.340
An adventure!?

22:49.340 --> 22:53.340
And I was worried for you when you were
fighting a certain military government!

22:53.340 --> 22:54.280
I know nothing about that!

22:54.280 --> 22:56.180
Don't go making up memories
about other people!

22:56.580 --> 22:58.850
Next episode of Haré+Guu, Final Episode:

22:58.850 --> 23:00.180
Next episode of Haré+Guu, Final Episode:

23:00.180 --> 23:01.780
Over... It's All Over.

23:01.780 --> 23:04.220
Then, shall we go defeat the final boss soon?

23:04.220 --> 23:04.990
There's no such thing!
